  <name>SCX Switcher</name>
  <summary>Switch sched_ext CPU schedulers</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      See which sched_ext CPU scheduler is running, start, stop or switch one, pick a mode
      for it, and choose whether it starts at boot. Built on the scx.service unit that ships
      with the sched-ext schedulers.
    </p>
